---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Contact — Independent Society"
  description="Get in touch with Independent Society — questions, feedback, or story pitches."
>
  <article class="container article-wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Contact</div>
    <h1>Get in touch</h1>
    <p class="article-lead">
      Have a question, feedback on a post, or a story you'd like to share?
      I read everything that comes in.
    </p>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        The best way to reach me is by email:
        <a href="mailto:suprun.jen@gmail.com">suprun.jen@gmail.com</a>
      </p>

      <p>
        A few things people usually write in about:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Feedback, corrections, or questions about a specific post</li>
        <li>Pitching a story or personal experience you'd like published here</li>
        <li>Partnership or collaboration inquiries</li>
        <li>General questions about Independent Society</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        I try to reply within a few days. If you're pitching a story,
        a couple of sentences on what it's about and why it fits Independent
        Society goes a long way.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>